","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Extend the reference inventory to every consumer of the removed names (certs.py:51 `remote_cert._VALID_KINDS`, opcert_service/__init__.py:14+18 re-export, app.py:217+222 `jobs.VALID_KINDS`), specifying for each whether the name is re-bound or removed, and account for frozenset-vs-tuple ordering where the value feeds argparse `choices` or user-facing `list(...)` text.","cohort":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":0.1,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan lists only three masters: `signing.py:115` OPCERT_KINDS, `opcert_service/jobs.py:38` VALID_KINDS, `_commands/remote_cert.py:24` _VALID_KINDS (+ _USAGE prose)","src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/certs.py:51: `parser.add_argument(\"kind\", choices=remote_cert._VALID_KINDS, ...)` — omitted consumer of _VALID_KINDS","src/rebar/opcert_service/__init__.py:14 `from rebar.opcert_service.jobs import VALID_KINDS, ...` and :18 `\"VALID_KINDS\",` in __all__ — omitted re-export of VALID_KINDS","src/rebar/opcert_service/app.py:217 `if kind not in jobs.VALID_KINDS:` and :222 `f\"kind must be one of {list(jobs.VALID_KINDS)}\"` — omitted consumers of VALID_KINDS"],"finding":"The plan enumerates the affected sites for the symbols it removes (VALID_KINDS at jobs.py:38, _VALID_KINDS at remote_cert.py:24) as only the definition sites plus the _USAGE prose, but omits every downstream consumer of those two names: certs.py:51 uses `choices=remote_cert._VALID_KINDS`; opcert_service/__init__.py:14,18 re-imports and re-exports VALID_KINDS; app.py:217,222 uses jobs.VALID_KINDS. A frozenset (OPCERT_KINDS) is unordered and, if the tuple names are dropped, these call sites break or change behavior.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff978ca08829f81db","impact":1.0,"is_primary":